observed = "NativeProgramDeploy and NativeProgramUpgrade restrict guestAbi to 1 | 2 | 3, and code() rejects ABI 4 and 5 at runtime; both decoders also re-encode through that restriction. programs/sdk/rust/src/abi_policy.rs admits versions 1 through 5 and the registry pipeline delegates to that policy. The AI-market guest uses ABI 5."
