proposal = "Update services/agent/sdk/typescript/src/program-lifecycle.ts deployment/upgrade types and validators from the shared admitted ABI policy. Prove ABI 4 and 5 deploy and monotonic upgrade payloads through the real registration consumer, retaining refusals for unsupported versions and downgrades."
